{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Not Everyone Leaves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/extras/Escape.gif?t=1743089180\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a dungeon where only some will make it out. Work together to fight enemies and solve puzzles, but when the exit appears, it\u2019s every player for themselves. Bring whatever equipment you want to increase you chances but if you die, you lose everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiplayer RPG, Short Rounds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/extras/Multiplayer.gif?t=1743089180\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run lasts 10\u201315 minutes, delivering a full RPG experience in a short session. No grinding, no waiting\u2014just action, strategy, and high-stakes decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Roguelike Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/extras/Maps.gif?t=1743089180\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dungeons are procedurally generated with randomized rooms, enemies, and obstacles. No two runs are the same. Adapt, take risks, and learn from failure\u2014because death is permanent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Loot &amp; Tradeoffs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/extras/Loot.gif?t=1743089180\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inventory space is limited. Choose what to bring in and what to take out. Weapons, potions, keys, or treasure\u2014you can\u2019t carry everything. Make every item count.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Classes &amp; Playstyles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from multiple classes, each with unique abilities. Some excel in combat, others in support or utility. Your class determines how you survive\u2014and how you compete.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3377400?t=1743089180","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/bbc9be9828a804212a88822e4a4c2d74de49281c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743089180","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/e82fbdd7ed63cd01fc7ce677272105917f17cc01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743089180","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/e82fbdd7ed63cd01fc7ce677272105917f17cc01/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743089180","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains fantasy violence where you fight other players and enemies in a dungeon."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Not Everyone Leaves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/extras/Escape.gif?t=1743089180\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a dungeon where only some will make it out. Work together to fight enemies and solve puzzles, but when the exit appears, it\u2019s every player for themselves. Bring whatever equipment you want to increase you chances but if you die, you lose everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiplayer RPG, Short Rounds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/extras/Multiplayer.gif?t=1743089180\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run lasts 10\u201315 minutes, delivering a full RPG experience in a short session. No grinding, no waiting\u2014just action, strategy, and high-stakes decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Roguelike Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/extras/Maps.gif?t=1743089180\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dungeons are procedurally generated with randomized rooms, enemies, and obstacles. No two runs are the same. Adapt, take risks, and learn from failure\u2014because death is permanent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Loot &amp; Tradeoffs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/extras/Loot.gif?t=1743089180\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inventory space is limited. Choose what to bring in and what to take out. Weapons, potions, keys, or treasure\u2014you can\u2019t carry everything. Make every item count.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Classes &amp; Playstyles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from multiple classes, each with unique abilities. Some excel in combat, others in support or utility. Your class determines how you survive\u2014and how you compete.</p>","developers":["Ballard Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/60420072aa884273d6796715f2d9998a33174ca6/header.jpg?t=1743089180","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> </li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li